["17"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["证据 B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["给婴儿洗澡先放冷水再兑热水，用手腕内侧或手肘试过再放孩子；能设出水温度的热水器调到 50 ℃ 以下"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["65 ℃ 的热水碰上 2 秒，多数大人就会烫成三度烧伤，婴儿皮肤更薄。盆里先放冷水再兑热水，搅匀了用手腕内侧或手肘试过再放孩子，别在开着的水龙头下洗。美国一个州把热水器出厂温度降到 49 ℃ 后，孩子因热水烫伤住院的少了一半多。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。每次洗澡多花一两分钟试水温。想更稳可以买个水温计。难在孩子哭闹、大人着急的时候也要试过再放"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["美国消费品安全委员会说，多数成年人碰到 150 ℉（约 65 ℃）的水 2 秒就会三度烧伤。碰到 140 ℉（60 ℃）的水 6 秒，或者 130 ℉（约 54 ℃）的水 30 秒，也会烫伤。就算是 120 ℉（49 ℃），泡上 5 分钟也可能三度烧伤。世卫组织的报告说，婴幼儿皮肤比成年人薄，较低的…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：给婴儿洗澡先放冷水再兑热水，用手腕内侧或手肘试过再放孩子；能设出水温度的热水器调到 50 ℃ 以下"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。每次洗澡多花一两分钟试水温。想更稳可以买个水温计。难在孩子哭闹、大人着急的时候也要试过再放"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["美国消费品安全委员会说，多数成年人碰到 150 ℉（约 65 ℃）的水 2 秒就会三度烧伤。碰到 140 ℉（60 ℃）的水 6 秒，或者 130 ℉（约 54 ℃）的水 30 秒，也会烫伤。就算是 120 ℉（49 ℃），泡上 5 分钟也可能三度烧伤。世卫组织的报告说，婴幼儿皮肤比成年人薄，较低的温度就能烫伤，而且烫得更深。美国儿科学会教家长：盆里的水用手腕内侧或手肘试，要「温而不烫」。「绝不要在流动的水下给宝宝洗澡」，因为水在管道里走，温度会忽高忽低，一点变化就可能烫伤。美国华盛顿州 1983 年立法，新热水器出厂要预设在 49 ℃。到 1988 年，家里热水的平均温度从 1977 年的 61 ℃ 降到 50 ℃。孩子因自来水烫伤住院的，从 70 年代每年 5.5 人降到每年 2.4 人。烫伤面积、植皮、死亡和住院天数也都少了。这是前后对比，不是分组试验。澳大利亚规定浴室热水龙头最高 50 ℃。新南威尔士州 1989 到 1996 年，0 到 4 岁孩子因烫伤住院的比率降了 13%。住院 10 天以上的重度烫伤，第二阶段后两年里降了 30%。国内三项儿童烧伤住院统计里，被热的液体烫伤的占 87.6% 到 90.6%，3 岁以下的孩子最多"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["US Consumer Product Safety Commission. Avoiding Tap Water Scalds (Document 5098). ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cpsc.gov/s3fs-public/5098.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cpsc.gov/s3fs-public/5098.pdf"]},"；American Academy of Pediatrics (2025). Bathing Your Baby. HealthyChildren.org. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.healthychildren.org/English/ages-stages/baby/bathing-skin-care/Pages/Bathing-Your-Newborn.aspx","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.healthychildren.org/English/ages-stages/baby/bathing-skin-care/Pages/Bathing-Your-Newborn.aspx"]},"；NHS. Washing and bathing your baby（2024-07-23 审阅）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nhs.uk/baby/caring-for-a-newborn/washing-and-bathing-your-baby/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nhs.uk/baby/caring-for-a-newborn/washing-and-bathing-your-baby/"]},"；World Health Organization, UNICEF (2008). World report on child injury prevention, Chapter 4 Burns（同一页有中文版《世界预防儿童伤害报告》）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/43851","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/43851"]},"；Erdmann TC, Feldman KW, Rivara FP, Heimbach DM, Wall HA (1991). Tap water burn prevention: the effect of legislation. Pediatrics, 88(3), 572-577. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://europepmc.org/article/MED/1881739","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://europepmc.org/article/MED/1881739"]},"；Xu JH, Qiu J, Zhou JH, et al. (2014). Pediatric burns in military hospitals of China from 2001 to 2007: a retrospective study. Burns, 40(8), 1780-1788. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.burns.2014.04.003","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.burns.2014.04.003"]},"；Zhu L, Zhang Y, Liu L, et al. (2013). Hospitalized pediatric burns in North China: a 10-year epidemiologic review. Burns, 39(5), 1004-1011. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.burns.2012.12.014","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.burns.2012.12.014"]},"；Han D, Wei Y, Li Y, et al. (2022). Epidemiological and Clinical Characteristics of 5,569 Pediatric Burns in Central China From 2013 to 2019. Frontiers in Public Health, 10, 751615. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fpubh.2022.751615","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.3389/fpubh.2022.751615"]},"；World Health Organization (2007). Legionella and the prevention of legionellosis. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/43233","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/43233"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["定 B 是因为数字来自前后对比和病历统计，没有分组试验。收益定中凭判断，因为国内洗澡水烫伤的单独数字没查到。热水器分两种。燃气热水器这类即热式的，直接把出水温度设到 50 ℃ 以下。储水式电热水器另算：世卫组织防军团菌的指南建议，热水器出水保持 60 ℃，水龙头热水不低于 50 ℃。军团菌是一种会引起肺炎的细菌。同一份指南也说，防军团菌不能增加孩子被烫的风险，可以在出水口装恒温混水阀。没装的，就靠先冷后热、试过再放。洗的时候人别走开。美国儿科学会说，在浴缸里淹死的孩子一半以上不满 1 岁，见第 1 节第 12 条（近水不离视线）。抱着孩子时别端热水热汤：世卫组织说，在高收入国家，1 岁以下婴儿最常见的是被杯子里的热饮烫伤。烫着了先冲凉水，见第 13 节第 14 条（烫伤后冲凉水）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/20-16"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"孩子出生后就每天喂 400 国际单位维生素 D，吃母乳的尤其别漏，足月的 6 个月内一般不用另补钙"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["按国家免疫规划把该打的疫苗打齐，全程免费，错过了只补没打完的剂次"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["国家免疫规划里的疫苗全程免费，接种单位不能收钱。孩子入托、入学都要查预防接种证，漏打的一般会被查出来补上。错过了只补没打完的那几剂，不用从头再打，换了厂家也能接…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["前 6 个月只喂母乳，连水都不用喂，6 个月起加辅食并继续母乳"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子出生后第一个小时里就开始喂奶。前 6 个月只喂母乳，连水都不用喂。满 6 个月起加辅食，每天要有含铁多的动物性食物，母乳接着喂到 2 岁或更久。母乳不够或者…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["冲奶粉用 70 ℃ 以上的水，冲好放凉再喂，喝剩的倒掉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["奶粉不是无菌的，可能带一种细菌，新生儿感染后四成到八成会死。先倒热水，等降到约 73.8 ℃ 再放奶粉，多数情况下能把这种菌杀到原来的十万分之一以下。热水会让维…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不满 1 岁不喂蜂蜜"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子不满 1 岁，不要喂蜂蜜。蜂蜜水、拌进辅食里的蜂蜜、含蜂蜜的糕点，都算。蜂蜜里可能带有引起肉毒中毒的细菌。大人肚子里的菌群能压住它，婴儿压不住。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出生时的维生素 K 针一定要打"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["新生儿身体里存的维生素 K 很少，不补可能出血，晚出现的那种常常是脑子里出血。塔什干没普遍做这种预防，每 10 万个新生儿有 478 个出这种血。做了预防，估计…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不满 3 个月的婴儿体温到 38 ℃ 就直接去医院，不在家观察"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子不满 3 个月，体温到 38 ℃ 就直接去医院。不要在家观察，也不要先喂退烧药再等等看。美国儿科学会专门给看着状态还可以的发热婴儿定了处理办法，所以「看着精…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/20"},"children":["阅读整个主题：刚出生的孩子怎么带 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth"